                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Nodes whose most recent execution was still not clean, judged per project and target. Deliberately ignores every filter and slicer on this page — it answers \"what is broken right now\", so narrowing it by a date range or a layer would hide work that still needs doing. A node that has since built cleanly is absent.'"
